---
description: >-
  Gitgraph covering TB direction, parallelCommits: true (disables temporal
  spacing), a custom mainBranchName ("production"), and a quoted branch name
  ("hotfix/v1.1"), rendered under the "neo" look with the "redux-dark-color"
  theme.
config:
  gitGraph:
    parallelCommits: true
    mainBranchName: production
  look: neo
  theme: redux-dark-color
---
gitGraph TB:
  commit id: "init" tag: "v0.1"
  branch staging
  checkout staging
  commit id: "s1"
  commit id: "s2" type: HIGHLIGHT
  checkout production
  commit id: "p1"
  merge staging id: "deploy-1" tag: "v1.0"
  commit id: "p2" type: REVERSE
  branch "hotfix/v1.1"
  checkout "hotfix/v1.1"
  commit id: "hf1"
  checkout production
  merge "hotfix/v1.1" id: "deploy-2" tag: "v1.1"
